    RefIds:
    - rid: 2838372046370505129
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: 'Skill title, verb. Shown after the title group as "Backgrounds - Enable": this skill unlocks the Backgrounds feature.'
    - rid: 2838372046370505130
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: 'Skill description: this skill unlocks the Backgrounds feature (choosing and unlocking playfield backgrounds).'
    - rid: 2838372046370505131
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Skill title, game term (noun phrase). The cash income multiplier for using the Preferred background (the background currently marked Preferred) as the active background. Shown as "Backgrounds - Preferred Multiplier".
    - rid: 2838372046370505132
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: 'Skill description. {0}: a number, the amount added to the Preferred Multiplier (the cash income multiplier for using the Preferred background as the active background).'
    - rid: 2838372046370505133
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Skill title. The skill increases the Preferred Multiplier by an amount for each background the player has unlocked. Shown as "Backgrounds - Preferred Multiplier Per Background".
    - rid: 2838372046370505134
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: 'Skill description. {0}: a number, added to the Preferred Multiplier (the cash income multiplier for using the Preferred background) for each background the player has unlocked.'
    - rid: 2838372046370505136
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: 'Skill title (verb phrase). Shown after the title group as "Flipper Bots - Flip Chests": the skill lets Flipper Bots flip chests too, not only rocks.'
    - rid: 2838372046370505137
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Skill description. Flipper Bots (floating robots that flip rocks for the player) can now flip chests too.
    - rid: 2838372046370505138
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: 'Skill title, game term. Shown after the title group as "Flipper Bots - Smart Pathing": Flipper Bots stop moving randomly and move to where they can flip the most rocks.'
    - rid: 2838372046370505139
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Skill description. Flipper Bots (floating robots that flip rocks for the player) stop moving randomly and move to where they can flip the most rocks.
    - rid: 2838372046370505140
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Skill description. This skill unlocks Flipper Bots, floating robots that flip rocks for the player.
    - rid: 2838372046370505141
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Extra skill description, shown under the description of the skill that unlocks Flipper Bots (floating robots). "Flip" means throwing a rock up into the air, the game's core action.
    - rid: 2838372046370505142
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: 'Skill title, stat name. Shown after the title group as "Flipper Bots - Active Time": how long a Flipper Bot stays active (moving and flipping) before it goes idle.'
    - rid: 2838372046370505143
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: 'Skill description. {0}: a number of seconds added to how long a Flipper Bot stays active (moving and flipping). "s" is the seconds unit.'
    - rid: 2838372046370505144
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: 'Skill title, stat name. Shown after the title group as "Flipper Bots - Flip Range": the radius around a Flipper Bot within which it flips rocks and chests.'
    - rid: 2838372046370505145
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: 'Skill description. {0}: a number added to the radius around a Flipper Bot within which it flips rocks and chests.'
    - rid: 2838372046370505146
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: 'Skill title, stat name. Shown after the title group as "Flipper Bots - Max Count": the maximum number of Flipper Bots.'
    - rid: 2838372046370505147
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: 'Skill description. {0}: a number added to the maximum number of Flipper Bots.'
    - rid: 2838372046370505148
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: 'Skill title, stat name. Shown after the title group as "Flipper Bots - Movement Speed": how fast Flipper Bots move.'
    - rid: 2838372046370505149
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: 'Skill description. {0}: a number, the percentage added to Flipper Bots'' movement speed.'
    - rid: 2838372046370505150
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: 'Skill title, game term. Shown after the title group as "Flipper Bots - Strength": the maximum number of rocks and chests a Flipper Bot flips at once (not physical strength).'
    - rid: 2838372046370505151
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: 'Skill description. {0}: a number added to Flipper Bot Strength, the maximum number of rocks and chests a Flipper Bot flips at once (not physical strength).'
    - rid: 2838372046370505152
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: 'Skill title, stat name. Shown after the title group as "Flipper Bots - Flipping Interval": the time between two flips of a Flipper Bot.'
    - rid: 2838372046370505153
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: 'Skill description. {0}: a number of seconds removed from the time between two flips of a Flipper Bot. "s" is the seconds unit.'
    - rid: 2838372046370505154
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: 'Skill title, stat name. Shown after the title group as "Flipper Bots - Idle Time": how long a Flipper Bot stays idle (not moving or flipping) before it becomes active again.'
    - rid: 2838372046370505155
